/**
 * DIGEST GUIDES WRITTEN FOR iOS.
 *
 * WHY A SEPARATE FILE. digest-content.ts, digest-bodies.ts and digest-heroes.ts all open with
 * "AUTO-SYNCED FROM THE WEB REPO. DO NOT EDIT THIS FILE". Adding guides there would be erased by
 * the next `sync-digest.sh`. Same reasoning as shop-items-extra.ts and sprites-additions.ts: the
 * synced file stays a clean copy, and everything iOS adds lives beside it and merges at read time.
 *
 * WHY THESE THREE CATEGORIES. The 35 synced guides cover Credit, Investing, Markets, Money basics
 * and Strategy. Between them they do not contain a single guide about INCOME, about HOUSING,
 * or about FRAUD. For an app whose age floor is 13, that is the wrong three things to be missing:
 * a first payslip, a first lease and a first scam attempt all arrive years before anyone's first
 * index fund.
 *
 * THE HEROES ARE PIXEL SPRITES, not SVG. The synced heroes are 3D-shaded scenes with radial
 * blooms, and they cannot be changed from here. These can be, so they match the app.
 */
